W(e^x, e^{-x}) = \begin{vmatrix} e^x &amp; e^{-x} \\ e^x &amp; -e^{-x} \end{vmatrix} = e^x(-e^{-x}) - e^x(e^{-x}) = -1 - 1 = -2 \neq 0 \quad \forall x \in \mathbb{R}
\end{aligned}\]
