&amp;= e^{-x}\big[ 0x^2 - 8Ax + (2A-4B) \big] = 64xe^{-x}
\end{aligned}\]
Igualando coeficientes obtenemos el sistema:
\[\begin{aligned}
\begin{cases} -8A = 64 \implies A = -8 \\ 2A - 4B = 0 \implies 2(-8) - 4B = 0 \implies B = -4 \end{cases}
