\[
\boxed{y_p(x) = e^{-x}\left(\frac{1}{4}\cos(2x)\ln|\cos 2x| + \frac{x}{2}\sin(2x)\right)}
\]</li><li><strong>(e) \(\boldsymbol{2y''+3y'+y=e^{-3x}}\):</strong>
